### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071
@batchId = sample-batch-123

### Process Documents - Single Document
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ProcessDocuments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": "{{batchId}}",
  "documents": [
    {
      "name": "invoice-001.xml",
      "xmlContent": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?><invoice><id>INV-001</id><customer>John Doe</customer><amount>150.00</amount><date>2024-01-15</date></invoice>"
    }
  ],
  "callbackUrl": "https://webhook.site/your-unique-url",
  "metadata": {
    "userId": "user123",
    "priority": "normal",
    "department": "sales"
  }
}

### Process Documents - Multiple Documents
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ProcessDocuments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": "multi-batch-456",
  "documents": [
    {
      "name": "document1.xml",
      "xmlContent": "<?xml version=\"1.0\"?><root><item id=\"1\">First Document</item></root>"
    },
    {
      "name": "document2.xml",
      "xmlContent": "<?xml version=\"1.0\"?><root><item id=\"2\">Second Document</item></root>"
    },
    {
      "name": "document3.xml",
      "xmlContent": "<?xml version=\"1.0\"?><root><item id=\"3\">Third Document</item></root>"
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "source": "api-test",
    "timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
  }
}

### Process Documents - Invalid XML (for testing validation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ProcessDocuments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": "error-test-789",
  "documents": [
    {
      "name": "invalid-document.xml",
      "xmlContent": "<root><unclosed-tag>This XML is malformed"
    },
    {
      "name": "valid-document.xml",
      "xmlContent": "<?xml version=\"1.0\"?><root><valid>This one is fine</valid></root>"
    }
  ]
}

### Get Processing Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/GetProcessingStatus/{{batchId}}

### Get Processing Status for Multi-Batch
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/GetProcessingStatus/multi-batch-456

### Get Processing Status for Error Test
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/GetProcessingStatus/error-test-789

### Get Document Status (individual document)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/GetDocumentStatus/sample-document-id

### Health Check (if available)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health